        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-29T20:33:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been thinking about it and I would love to see a \"Big Box\" released when the Sentinels card game storyline wraps up. &nbsp;It could include every hero, villain, and environment deck ever produced with all the appropriate errata and promos. &nbsp;Even though I already own every SotM deck, I would still buy two of these if they existed: &nbsp;One to keep mint in the box forever and another to play til the cards fall apart&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:58.007Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
