        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I&#39;ve been thinking about it and I would love to see a &quot;Big Box&quot; released when the Sentinels card game storyline wraps up. &nbsp;It could include every hero, villain, and environment deck ever produced with all the appropriate errata and promos. &nbsp;Even though I already own every SotM deck, I would still buy two of these if they existed: &nbsp;One to keep mint in the box forever and another to play til the cards fall apart&nbsp; :slightly_smiling_face: ",
