        "created_at": "2014-07-30T01:05:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I completely agree. By then, I'll probably need to replace everything, anyway.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>But seriously, yeah, I agree with this sentiment. Not sure there would be enough interest, but it would be awesome to find out. Maybe a Kickstarter…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>",
